        "text": "I’ll use the standard cycle-coloring formula, which runs in O(log n) time. I also found a test inconsistency: `tests.py` expects 3 for `(4, 2)`, while the specification correctly gives 2. I’ll verify that case by exhaustive enumeration before correcting the test.",
